This package contains a Distutils interface to build a Python extension and
create a distribution for Stride library. 
SWIG (version 1.3.20 or higher) is used/required for generating a C wrapper
code.

To build the extension and install the package in 'sys.exec_prefix/lib/python2.4/site-packages':

	python2.4 setup.py install
This will create 'build' directory, generate the extension - 
_stride.so in './build/lib.<platform_specifier>/stride',
copy python modules (__init__.py and created by SWIG stride.py) from 
'./stride' to '.build/lib.<platform_specifier>/stride',
and install the stride  package in 'sys.exec_prefix/lib/python2.4/site-packages/'.

To build the extension and install the package in a specified directory:
	python2.4 setup.py install --install-platlib=INSTALL_DIR
where INSTALL_DIR is the path to a directory where you want to install the
stride package. 

To build the extension only:

	python2.4 setup.py build_ext
     		or
	python2.4 setup.py build
( this will also copy the pure python code into ./build/lib.<platform_specifier>/stride)

To build the distribution:
   	python2.4 setup.py sdist

To build binary distribution:
   	python2.4 setup.py bdist
